[[31,63,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before removing and refitting\nthe pretensioners, observe all the specified safety regulations\n(<a href=\"#/3025922\">7065A</a> ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[31,63,32,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025836\">7040L40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025879\">7050A22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025828\">7040H50</a></p><p>1. Remove the embellishment.</p><p>2. Undo the nut.</p><p>3. Move the seat belt mechanism.</p><p>4. Remove the knob.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005473.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,32,"<p>1. Undo the nut.</p><p>2. Remove the pin and release the seat belt.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connection from the pretensioner.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Driver&#x27;s seat belt pre-tensioner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024683\">Q20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Front passenger seat belt pretensioner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024686\">Q21</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Unscrew the bolt.</p><p>5. Remove the seat belt with pretensioner.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005474.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,32,"<p>Place the pretensioenr in the special cabinet,\nresting it on a free surface.</p>"],[31,63,32,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refit the pretensioner (1a), making sure that seat (1b) connects\nto the corresponding body retainer.</p><p>2. Tighten the bolt to the specified torque.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not use impact tools for tightening.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT SEAT BELT PRETENSIONER.</p></td><td><p>M7/16&#x27;</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Connect the electrical connection for the pretensioner.</p><p>4. Position the seat belt in its seat and insert the pin.</p><p>5. tighten the nut.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005475.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,32,"<p>1. Fit the knob.</p><p>2. Fit the seat belt mechanism.</p><p>3. Tighten the nut to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>FRONT SEAT BELT IDLER</p></td><td><p>M7/16&quot;</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Fit the trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005476.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,32,"<p><a href=\"#/3025828\">7040H50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025879\">7050A22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025836\">7040L40</a></p><p>Check the operation of the system using\nthe Examiner or the other diagnostic equipment.</p>"],[31,63,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before removing and refitting\nthe pretensioners, observe all the specified safety regulations\n(<a href=\"#/3025922\">7065A</a> ).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[31,63,64,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025825\">7040H36</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025826\">7040H38</a></p><p>1. Undo the nut.</p><p>2. Remove the pin and release the seat belt.</p><p>3. Unscrew the bolt.</p><p>4. Move the pretensioner (4a) over slightly, releasing it from the\nretainers (4b).</p><p>5. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>Driver&#x27;s seat belt pre-tensioner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024683\">Q20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p>Front passenger seat belt pretensioner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024686\">Q21</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>6. Recover the seat belt with pretensioner.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005477.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,64,"<p>Place the pretensioenr in the special cabinet,\nresting it on a free surface.</p>"],[31,63,64,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Connect the electrical connection for the pretensioner.</p><p>2. Refit the pretensioner (2a), engaging the retainers (2b) on the\nbodywork.</p><p>3. Tighten the bolt to the specified torque.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not use impact tools for tightening.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT SEAT BELT PRETENSIONER.</p></td><td><p>M7/16&#x27;</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Position the seat belt in its seat and insert the pin.</p><p>5. Tighten the nut.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005478.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,64,"<p><a href=\"#/3025826\">7040H38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025825\">7040H36</a></p><p>Check the operation of the system using\nthe Examiner or the other diagnostic equipment.</p>"]]